# HTTP to HTTPS redirect (all requests)
http://* https://:splat 301

# Non-www to www (canonical is www)
https://platypusautomations.com/* https://www.platypusautomations.com/:splat 301

# Clean URLs are handled natively by Cloudflare Pages: it serves /voice-agent
# from voice-agent.html and 308-redirects the .html form to the clean one with
# no configuration. The explicit rules that used to live here (.html -> clean
# 301, then clean -> .html 200) fought that native behavior and produced an
# infinite redirect loop, taking down all four service pages plus privacy,
# terms, and website-gbp from July 27 to August 1, 2026. Do not re-add them.
# Verify with: curl -sI -L https://www.platypusautomations.com/voice-agent

# Serve index.html for root without redirect
/ /index.html 200
